---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="HTML & CSS Cheat Sheet | Free Flexbox, Grid & Responsive Reference"
  description="Complete HTML and CSS cheat sheet with flexbox, grid, selectors, responsive design, and common patterns. Free reference for web developers."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>HTML &amp; CSS<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Flexbox, grid, selectors, responsive design, and common patterns. From basics to advanced front-end.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>HTML Essentials</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Semantic Elements</h3>
        <pre><code>&lt;header&gt;   &lt;nav&gt;      &lt;main&gt;
&lt;article&gt;  &lt;section&gt;  &lt;aside&gt;
&lt;footer&gt;   &lt;figure&gt;   &lt;figcaption&gt;
&lt;details&gt;  &lt;summary&gt;  &lt;dialog&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Forms &amp; Accessibility</h3>
        <pre><code>&lt;form action="/submit" method="POST"&gt;
  &lt;label for="email"&gt;Email&lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;input type="email" id="email"
         required aria-describedby="hint"&gt;
  &lt;button type="submit"&gt;Send&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Flexbox</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Container Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;    /* row | column */
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 1rem;
}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Item Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>.item {
  flex: 1;           /* grow equally */
  flex: 0 0 200px;   /* fixed width */
  align-self: flex-end;
  order: -1;         /* first */
}

/* Center anything */
.center {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 100vh;
}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>CSS Grid</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Grid Layout</h3>
        <pre><code>.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

/* Responsive grid */
auto-grid {
  grid-template-columns:
    repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Spanning &amp; Placement</h3>
        <pre><code>.span-2 {
  grid-column: span 2;
}

.sidebar {
  grid-column: 1 / 3;
  grid-row: 1 / -1;
}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Selectors &amp; Specificity</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Selector Types</h3>
        <pre><code>.class { }          /* class */
#id { }             /* id */
div &gt; p { }        /* child */
p ~ p { }           /* sibling */
a:hover { }         /* pseudo-class */
::before { }        /* pseudo-element */
[data-type="x"] { } /* attribute */</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Specificity Hierarchy</h3>
        <pre><code>/* Inline (1000) */
style="..."

/* ID (100) */
#header

/* Class/attr/pseudo (10) */
.nav-item:hover

/* Element/pseudo (1) */
div p</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Responsive Design</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Media Queries</h3>
        <pre><code>/* Mobile first */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .sidebar { display: block; }
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .content { max-width: 900px; }
}

/* Container queries */
@container (min-width: 500px) {
  .card { flex-direction: row; }
}</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>CSS Variables &amp; Theming</h3>
        <pre><code>:root {
  --color-primary: #3b82f6;
  --spacing: 1rem;
  --radius: 8px;
}

.card {
  background: var(--color-primary);
  padding: var(--spacing);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
